<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam inflation slips to 3.7 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Vietnam inflation slips to 3.7 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam's General Statistics Office issued the following economic indicators on Tuesday:</p>
<p> VIETNAM CONSUMER PRICES		Feb 97     Jan 97     Feb 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month percentage change    +1.8	 +0.8	 +2.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year percentage change	+3.7	 +4.4	 +9.0</p>
<p> Index (base 100 = prev. Dec)	 102.6	100.8	103.5</p>
</text>
